<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-SYDNEY INTERNATIONAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SYDNEY INTERNATIONAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the Sydney International tennis tournament on Friday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Men's singles semifinals:</p>
<p>Tim Henman (Britain) beat 1-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) 4-6 7-6 (7-1) 6-1</p>
<p>Carlos Moya (Spain) beat 3-Albert Costa (Spain) 3-6 6-3  7-6 (8-6).</p>
<p>Women's singles semifinals:</p>
<p>Jennifer Capriati (U.S.) beat 4-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) 2-6 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>2-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.) 6-3 6-2</p>
</text>
